// Lucide — the one icon family (EXPERIENCE.md §8.1 rule 7), the same as iOS.
// GENERATED from the font iOS bundles (nuru-member-ios
// NuruMember/Resources/Fonts/lucide.ttf, ISC-licensed, lucide.dev): each
// glyph's outline, flipped into a 1000-unit viewport — the em box iOS draws
// at the icon's point size — so an icon here is the shape iOS draws, at the
// same size. Don't edit by hand. To add a glyph: fontTools, the glyph named
// as on lucide.dev, drawn through TransformPen(SVGPathPen(glyphSet, ntos=
// lambda v: '%g' % v), (1, 0, 0, -1, 0, 1000)) — the font's em is 1000 with
// ascent 1000 — and the entry placed in name order. That recipe reproduces
// every entry here byte for byte (checked 2026-10-07, 127 glyphs).
